{"case_id": "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q4", "domain": "unknown", "question": "以下哪项描述符合命主的子息状况？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主为己土，生于申月，金旺土虚，日坐巳火为印星，时柱壬申金水相生。女命以食伤为子女星，此八字中食伤为金（庚、申），金在月令得旺，且时柱透壬水（财星）生官杀（木），但原局木星不显，仅月干甲木（正官）虚浮无根，且被庚金克伐，暗示子星受制。\n\n再看大运，命主生于1980年，当前（假设为2023年左右）行至癸未运（约2015-2025），未为木库，可助官星，但原局官星弱，且时柱壬申金水旺，水多木漂，子星难立。结合流年，2004甲申年，甲木官星透出，但申金冲克日支巳火，且甲木坐申金绝地，此年虽有怀孕可能，但难成或难存；2010庚寅年，庚金克甲木，寅申冲，亦不利子息。\n\n综合判断，命主子息缘薄，且身体方面金旺克木，木主肝胆、生殖系统，易有生育障碍，故最符合“没有子女，因为身体不能生育”的描述。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "guangdong_female_19800824_P001-Q4", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_1_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4998, "response_id": "34292ab7-2256-4601-84c1-db61c3e1cba5", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 236, "completion_tokens": 301, "total_tokens": 537, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 108}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
