{"case_id": "chaozhou_male_19720108_P002-Q6", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主的性格和情绪？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：年柱辛亥，月柱辛丑，日柱戊戌，时柱丁巳。日主戊土生于丑月，得令，且时柱丁巳火生土，日支戌土为根，土势强旺。戊土厚重，主信实、稳重，但土旺无制时容易固执。月干辛金伤官透出，年干辛金亦透，伤官旺者通常聪明、有才华，但情绪上容易挑剔、不满，有时会显得孤高。时柱丁火正印贴身，印星主仁慈、儒雅，且丁火为灯烛之火，有文雅之气。地支巳火、戌土、丑土、亥水，水火土皆有，但土最旺，水弱，金有根。整体来看，命主性格外显为土性之敦厚，但伤官透干带来内心敏感与表达欲，印星又使其有文化修养。选项中，D“乐于交际。独处时，又自得其乐”最符合戊土日主得印星生扶、伤官透出但非孤僻的组合——土主包容，乐于与人相处，而印星又使其能静心自处。A过于孤僻，不符土之厚重；B有暴力倾向，八字中无七杀强旺或冲克，不符；C“爱蟋蟀书画之乐”虽带文雅，但“儒雅”更偏印星，而伤官透出更显交际与表达，D更全面。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "chaozhou_male_19720108_P002-Q6", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_1_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5994, "response_id": "9938bc19-888e-45c2-94a1-6326ff8f0f2c", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 243, "completion_tokens": 338, "total_tokens": 581, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 115}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
